filenumber 632803
! STAGE 1 -- res1808.in physics rerun on FIXED HBI, uniform initial perm.
! Combination B: correct reservoir viscosity eta 1.27e-4 with beta scaled by 7.007874
! so that D = k/(eta*phi*beta) is UNCHANGED from combination A.
!
! permev T with UNIFORM kp = kpmin = 1e-15; slip grows it toward
! kpmax = 5e-14. No permeability map -- parameterfromfile F. The
! near-well high-permeability zone is therefore created DYNAMICALLY by slip,
! which is what distinguishes Stage 1 from Stage 2.
!
! phi 0.01 x beta 1.4051e-07 ;  D(far, at kpmin) = 5.6039e-03 m^2/s
! tau0 = muinit x sigmainit = 11.10 MPa  (Taiyi 15.0, so understressed)
!
! DELIBERATE deviations from the parent deck:
!   injection_file -> june_clean.txt. The data being matched are the June 2012
!     stage; the parent used april_clean_fixed2.txt. This is NOT a
!     reproduction of the parent -- same physics, different stimulation.
!   imax/jmax 600 -> 601, so the injector is the exact centre cell (301,301).
!   tmax -> 0.01369863 yr = 5.00 d. Both wellhead spikes (0.95 d, 1.58 d) are
!     inside the first flowing block, which ends at 1.576 d.
!   dtout -> 0.0002 yr (1.75 h); 0.001 gave only ~14 frames in 5 d.
!
! rw 8.9e-2 and Sw_fwid 7.4e-9 are inherited unchanged -- they were ALREADY
! in the parent deck and are not new parameters.
!
! CAVEAT: holding D fixed does NOT reproduce combination A. The Peaceman
! well index T = 2*pi*k/eta (m_diffusion.f90:669) depends on eta ALONE, so
! gamma = (Sw_fwid/h)/((Sw_fwid/h)+T) (m_diffusion.f90:671) is not preserved:
! 0.977 -> 0.858 at the initial kp, and 0.145 -> 0.024 once kp reaches kpmax.
! Also phi*beta = 1.405e-09 is ~3.9x above the maximum the stated
! physical ranges allow (phi<=0.02, beta<=2e-8). Deliberate, for diffusivity
! consistency; see docs/figs/cooper_basin_calibration.
problem 3dp
imax 601
jmax 601
ds 0.005
interval 30
nstep 40000
tmax 0.01369863
dtmax 43200
dtout 0.0002
parameterfromfile F
backslip T
vpl 0d0
a 0.015
b 0.012
dc 1e-4
f0 0.6
muinit 0.37
sigmainit 30.0
velinit 1d-12
limitsigma T
minsig 1
velmin 1d-20
pressurediffusion T
permev T
kpmax 5e-14
kpmin 1e-15
kp 1e-15
phi 0.01
beta 1.4051e-07
eta 1.27e-4
kL 1e-3
kT 1e15
pfinit 0d0
bcl Dirichlet
bcr Dirichlet
bct Dirichlet
bcb Dirichlet
pbcl 0d0
pbcr 0d0
pbct 0d0
pbcb 0d0
injectionfromfile T
injection_file "june_clean.txt"
rigid 24
Sw_fwid 7.4e-9
rw 8.9e-2
